  "description": "Batteries-included default for Elarion feature flags: wires the OpenFeature Microsoft.FeatureManagement provider behind Elarion's OpenFeature-backed IFeatureFlagService, so [FeatureGate] reads config-driven feature flags out of the box. Opt-in via AddElarionFeatureManagement; built on Elarion.FeatureFlags.OpenFeature, so swapping to another OpenFeature provider (LaunchDarkly, ConfigCat, flagd, ...) needs no gating changes.",
